             :kind :function
             :intent "(my.program/overrides {}) answers [] on a branch with 21 changed identities; propose-merge! takes only :seon.issue/id, sweeps in drift the branch inherits (my.plan-test/current-refuses-an-unknown-agent-by-name), omits deletions from `:seon.test/changed`, and sends its content as a pr-str string. Selection exists only in root's prepare-merge!."
