             :kind :function
             :intent "breaks for a contract change takes the contract only as a string, titles every plan issue 'must be repaired before retracting', lists the subject as its own caller, and never states the arity mismatch (call sites show the old arity only); the install gate does not consult it for an arity-changing redefinition."
